Name: rsync

    rsync 3.5.2 with no Fil-C changes.  The old rsync-3.5.0 directory was
    a pristine upstream import (it is one of the projects that did not
    need any Fil-C changes); this projeny file replaces it for packaging
    so that the deprecated source-directory mode can be retired for it.
